  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 350°F (180°C).",
    "In a large bowl, combine Grape Nuts, chickpeas, zucchini, carrot, parsley and cilantro.",
    "Add olive oil, harissa paste, cumin, coriander, salt and pepper to the bowl and mix until the mixture is evenly coated.",
    "Press the mixture firmly into a greased 9x5-inch loaf pan, smoothing the top with a spatula.",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 35 to 40 minutes until the top is golden brown and the loaf is firm to the touch.",
    "Remove the roast from the oven and let it rest in the pan for 10 minutes before slicing.",
    "Slice the loaf into 8 pieces and serve warm, drizzled with a little extra olive oil and a squeeze of fresh lemon juice. ",
    "Enjoy this fragrant, nutty Tunisian roast as a romantic dinner centerpiece."
  ],
